'''Galactic Overseer Nyandam''' (ギャラクシーニャンダム, ''Gyarakushī Nyandamu'', '''Galaxy Nyandam''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] that first appears as the boss in [[The Great Abyss (Into the Future)|The Great Abyss]] Chapter 2. He was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]].

